  "body": "### What are you trying to do\n\nRight now the WCS selection displays the midpoints of face edges for selection.    I would like to select corners of the part.\n\n<img width=\"1408\" height=\"810\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/744718b9-9059-4798-9ff8-85d0957a0888\" />\n\n### How you imagine it working\n\nIncrease the number of vertices available for WCS selection from just the midpoints to all the corners as well.  \n\nThe center of circles (holes) and slots should be available to select as well. \n\n",
